      "text_preview": "\n6. Clause 2.4.3 of the Food Safety and Standards Rules, 2011 is as under:\n\"2.4.3: Action by Designated Officer on the report of Food Analyst."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9fc759001ec84ea1bb0d8a20b1a09a78_17",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If, after considering the report, the Designated Officer is of the opinion for reason(s) to be recorded in writing, that the report delivered by the Food Analyst under Rule 2.4.2 (5) is erroneous, he shall forward one of the parts of the sa"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a1bfd9e9608942788daa8eb8a2648aa0_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the aforesaid rule, upon receipt of the report from the food analyst under Rule 2.4.2 (5) the designated officer has to form an opinion which has to be recorded in writing giving reasons that the said report is erroneous."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8373cb0c1cb94383b0fbf8bbb1b4c31a_19",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thereafter, he may forward the sample to the referral laboratory for analysis."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9b9dc6150a954365b8048b54b92e2a86_20",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, in the present matter the designated officer by his NEUTRAL CITATION NO.\n2024:MPHC-IND:25520 4 WP-10219-2024 letter dated 19.10.2023 has only recorded that the report received from the food analyst is erroneous and unsatisfactory."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ed4d8a51562c467d996e9d38d1cf8ece_21",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, opinion based on reasons to be recorded in writing has not been formed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fc0288d1e04442d995fa9876f7569d85_22",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It was imperative for him to record his reasons in writing as to why he has formed an opinion that the report delivered by the food analyst is erroneous."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85f7e28943374e849d8c2aa4acd42628_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, he as not done so."
    },
